      <details class="opblock opblock-get">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-get">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-get">GET</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/auth/cards</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">List enabled login cards</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Retrieve enabled authentication cards for display on the public sign-in view.

Returns only non-sensitive login button metadata in sort_rank order.
Excludes private configs, secrets, email domains, and disabled cards.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
