          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Start OIDC/OAuth2 login flow for an enabled card</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Start OIDC/OAuth2 login flow for an enabled card.

Maps ?next= to return_to. Returns 404 NOT_FOUND for disabled cards or non-OIDC/OAuth2 kinds.</p>
