    <section class="opblock-tag-section">
      <h2 class="opblock-tag-header">custom-field-execution <span class="tag-count">(3)</span></h2>
      <details class="opblock opblock-get">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-get">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-get">GET</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/issues/{issue_key}/custom-fields</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">List computed and cached custom field values for an issue</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Retrieve all custom field values for an issue.

When X-Kanban-Script-Depth &gt;= 1 (or request.state.script_depth &gt;= 1),
serves cached rows only and avoids recursive execution.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>issue_key</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
