          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Cookieless SSRF-defended external media proxy</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Retrieve external Markdown image over DNS-pinned cookieless socket.

Requires authenticated principal and enforces MEDIA_PROXY_PRINCIPAL rate limits.
Validates HMAC signature before URL parsing or DNS lookup.</p>
