    <section class="opblock-tag-section">
      <h2 class="opblock-tag-header">objects-access <span class="tag-count">(2)</span></h2>
      <details class="opblock opblock-get">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-get">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-get">GET</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/objects/{object_id}/access</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Get anti-enumeration access manifest for an object</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Retrieve structured access sharing metadata for an object under S3.4 rules.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>object_id</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-2xx">200</span></td><td>Successful Response</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-4xx">422</span></td><td>Validation Error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>cURL Example</h4>
              <pre class="curl-box"><code>curl -X GET "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/objects/{object_id}/access" -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="opblock opblock-post">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-post">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-post">POST</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/objects/{object_id}/access/agent-kill-switch</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Revoke access for all automated agents on an object</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Instantly revoke access for all active agents on an object by upserting DENY Capability.ALL.

Requires Capability.SHARE or Capability.ADMIN on the target object.
Appends an immutable AGENT_ACCESS_KILLED entry to the activity ledger and returns
the refreshed AccessManifest.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>object_id</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-2xx">200</span></td><td>Successful Response</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-4xx">422</span></td><td>Validation Error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>cURL Example</h4>
              <pre class="curl-box"><code>curl -X POST "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/objects/{object_id}/access/agent-kill-switch" -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>
    <section class="opblock-tag-section">
      <h2 class="opblock-tag-header">project-config <span class="tag-count">(12)</span></h2>
      <details class="opblock opblock-get">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-get">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-get">GET</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">List project labels</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">List project labels available for tagging issues ordered alphabetically by name.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>project_ref</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-2xx">200</span></td><td>Successful Response</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-4xx">422</span></td><td>Validation Error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>cURL Example</h4>
              <pre class="curl-box"><code>curl -X GET "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels" -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="opblock opblock-post">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-post">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-post">POST</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Create a label</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Create a new project label with name and hex color token (project EDIT or ADMIN allowed).</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>project_ref</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-2xx">201</span></td><td>Successful Response</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-4xx">422</span></td><td>Validation Error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>cURL Example</h4>
              <pre class="curl-box"><code>curl -X POST "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels" -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="opblock opblock-patch">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-patch">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-patch">PATCH</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels/{label_id}</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Update a label</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Update a project label name or color code (project ADMIN capability required).</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
              <table class="param-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Required</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>project_ref</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>label_id</code></td><td>path</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>string</code></td><td></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Responses</h4>
              <table class="resp-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-2xx">200</span></td><td>Successful Response</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><span class="status-badge status-4xx">422</span></td><td>Validation Error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>cURL Example</h4>
              <pre class="curl-box"><code>curl -X PATCH "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels/{label_id}" -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="opblock opblock-delete">
        <summary class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-delete">
          <span class="opblock-method opblock-method-delete">DELETE</span>
          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/projects/{project_ref}/labels/{label_id}</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Delete a label</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Permanently delete a project label, removing it from all tagged issues.

