          <span class="opblock-path">/api/v1/projects/{project}/workflow-hooks/reorder</span>
          <span class="opblock-summary-text">Atomically reorder workflow hooks for a transition</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="opblock-body">
          <p class="opblock-desc">Atomically rewrite sort_rank for hooks in transition. Requires PROJECT_ADMIN and AAL2.</p>
          <div class="opblock-details-grid">
            <div class="opblock-section">
              <h4>Parameters</h4>
